Zero point energy                ...      0.09762003 Eh      61.26 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00341058 Eh       2.14 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
